# The clock suffix that ties a part of the day to an hour without "às": "nove
# da manhã, três da tarde" (Senado Federal, Manual de Comunicação, s.v.
# "Hora").  "de manhã" is the part of the day itself, "Entre o amanhecer e o
# meio-dia" (Priberam, "manhã").  extract_timespan reads "duas horas de
# manhã" as the clock 02:00.  extract_event reads the count as a length in
# the morning only when a word that no reading takes stands before it and
# this suffix does not follow it: "reunião de duas horas de manhã" is a
# length, "jantar nove horas da noite" is 21:00.  Without "horas" the number
# is no count of hours: "duas e meia de manhã" is 02:30.
da
